iv",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/halloween-voiceover.jpg","alt":"halloween-voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br>\r\n<h2>What is Halloween?</h2>\r\n<p><i>Halloween or Hallowe'en (a contraction of All Hallows' Evening), also known as Allhalloween, All Hallows' Eve or All Saints' Eve, is a celebration observed in a number of countries on 31 October, the eve of the Western Christian feast of All Hallows' Day. It begins the three-day observance of Allhallowtide, the time in the liturgical year dedicated to remembering the dead, including saints (hallows), martyrs, and all the faithful departed.</i></p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Do get in touch if you dare...</h2>\r\n<p>If you have a production, event or film that you need a Halloween Voiceover,  do get in touch. Use the <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\">contact page</a> \r\nand lets chat. <br>Send a few lines and I'd be very happy to send a short sample before you book me so you can be sure I'm right for your brand. <br>\r\nI'll make the whole process scarily easy, with 99% of the jobs delivered the same day.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Halloween Voiceover Showreel","pageUrl":"halloween-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","809",{"href":"/which-recording-studio-software-is-best","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-